            <ArticleTitle>Laparoscopic sleeve gastrectomy in five awake obese patients using paravertebral and superficial cervical plexus blockade.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>993-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/anae.13037</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report laparoscopic sleeve gastrectomy in five awake obese patients, completed under regional anaesthesia provided by paravertebral and superficial cervical plexus blockade. The technique was acceptable to patients, surgeons and anaesthetists.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>© 2015 The Association of Anaesthetists of Great Britain and Ireland.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
